// Debug build configuration (tracked, portable across machines).
//
// Signing identity is the one thing that differs per Mac — the certificate
// resolves to a keychain-local SHA-1, so it can't live in a shared file. We pull
// it in from a gitignored per-machine override with the optional-include syntax:
// `#include?` includes the file if present and silently skips it otherwise, so a
// freshly-cloned Mac that hasn't been bootstrapped still configures (it just
// falls back to whatever the project declares). See docs/28_xcode-signing.
#include? "Debug.local.xcconfig"
